  "text": "AFK King Black Dragon\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n\n⬥ Position yourself on one of the marked tiles.\n​\nMelee AFK Method (110+ kph)\nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Ek-ZekKil  or Dragon bane 2h sword \n⬥ Dragon Slayer \n    • Where it is slotted varies depending on setup.\n    •  may be perked with   + \n⬥ Armour perked with Equilibrium 4  > Biting 4 \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \nAbilities\n⬥ Chaos Roar \n    • Expect less kph if not using.\nOther\n⬥ Elder overload salve \n    • May be replaced by lower tier overload + super antifire combo.\n⬥ Wilderness access bonus\n    • Using the Wilderness artefact grants a 10% damage increase.\n    • Use a  to teleport to the level 44 Wilderness entrance.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee \n\n⬥ May use lower gear at the cost of kills per hour.\n​\nAction Bars\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee \n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK King Black Dragon ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ⬥ Position yourself on one of the marked tiles. ​ Melee AFK Method (110+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Ek-ZekKil or Dragon bane 2h sword ⬥ Dragon Slayer • Where it is slotted varies depending on setup. • may be perked with + ⬥ Armour perked with Equilibrium 4 > Biting 4 ⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket or Igneous Kal-Zuk Abilities ⬥ Chaos Roar • Expect less kph if not using. Other ⬥ Elder overload salve • May be replaced by lower tier overload + super antifire combo. ⬥ Wilderness access bonus • Using the Wilderness artefact grants a 10% damage increase. • Use a to teleport to the level 44 Wilderness entrance. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee ⬥ May use lower gear at the cost of kills per hour. ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee ​",
